                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[8/10] ★★★★☆\r\n\r\nWest of Loathing is worth the full price. Despite the goofy presentation of the game, the game takes itself somewhat seriously with story beats and worldbuilding, which just amplifies the goofiness even better, it's very sincere in its humor which makes the game very enjoyable. The combat is fun, gameplay has cool side quests and areas to check out, and the game is paced out pretty well. It's a fun silly time.",
